WEBVTT

00:07:29.369 --> 00:07:32.963
the mechanics, the methods that you use,

00:07:32.987 --> 00:07:35.562
is equal to the story itself.

00:07:35.586 --> 00:07:38.900
And I'm one who loves
high tech and low tech.

00:07:38.924 --> 00:07:40.699
So I could go from --

00:07:40.723 --> 00:07:43.200
For instance, I'll show you
some "Spider-Man" later,

00:07:43.224 --> 00:07:45.776
these incredible machines
that move people along.

00:07:45.800 --> 00:07:48.142
But the fact is, without the dancer

00:07:48.166 --> 00:07:50.895
who knows how to use his body
and swing on those wires,

00:07:50.919 --> 00:07:52.682
it's nothing.

00:07:52.706 --> 00:07:55.591
So now I'm going to show you

00:07:55.615 --> 00:07:59.909
some clips from the other big
project of my life this year,

00:07:59.933 --> 00:08:00.951
"The Tempest."